WEBVTT

00:06.965 --> 00:08.137
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.241 --> 00:10.034
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:10.137 --> 00:11.344
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:11.448 --> 00:13.758
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:13.862 --> 00:16.448
<i>♪ Oh ♪</i>
<i>♪哦♪</i>

00:16.551 --> 00:18.551
<i>♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪</i>
<i>♪谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪</i>

00:18.655 --> 00:20.551
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:20.655 --> 00:22.862
<i>♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪</i>
<i>♪ 吸水性、黄色
他是多孔的 ♪</i>

00:22.965 --> 00:24.413
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:24.517 --> 00:26.586
<i>♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪</i>

00:26.689 --> 00:28.034
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:28.137 --> 00:30.655
<i>♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪</i>

00:30.758 --> 00:32.551
<i>- ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
- Ready?</i>
<i>- ♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪
- 准备好了吗？</i>

00:32.655 --> 00:34.586
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:34.689 --> 00:36.827
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:36.931 --> 00:38.482
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:38.586 --> 00:42.000
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:45.655 --> 00:46.655
<i>Argh!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

01:00.310 --> 01:02.413
Steady, Plankton.
稳住，浮游生物。

01:02.517 --> 01:04.379
Careful.
小心。

01:04.896 --> 01:06.172
Ooh!
哦！

01:12.344 --> 01:14.551
What is all that noise?
这些噪音是什么？

01:18.793 --> 01:21.137
What is so funny?
有什么好笑的？

01:21.241 --> 01:22.241
- This!
- Huh?
- 这！
- 啊？

01:23.310 --> 01:25.241
Hopping hineys!
跳跃海尼！

01:25.344 --> 01:26.862
Put those away!
把那些收起来！

01:26.965 --> 01:29.448
Oh, don't be embarrassed.
哦，别尴尬。

01:29.551 --> 01:32.344
It's just your baby pictures.
这只是你宝宝的照片。

01:32.448 --> 01:34.724
You were adorable.
你很可爱。

01:34.827 --> 01:37.965
I was never adorable.
我从来就不可爱。

01:38.068 --> 01:40.310
These photos have got to go.
这些照片必须删除。

01:40.689 --> 01:41.896
Whoa!
哇！

01:43.172 --> 01:45.103
You were such a cute baby.
你真是个可爱的宝宝。

01:45.206 --> 01:47.137
Oh, I can't stand it!
唉，我受不了了！

01:47.241 --> 01:48.551
Yoink!
哟哟！

01:48.655 --> 01:50.206
- Aw.
- Boo!
- 噢。
- 嘘！

01:50.724 --> 01:53.379
I'm not cute
and adorable.
我不可爱
和可爱的。

01:53.482 --> 01:55.896
I'm horrifying and evil!
我是可怕又邪恶的！

01:56.586 --> 01:57.482
Hmph!
哼！

02:02.620 --> 02:06.000
Plankton was the cutest baby
I've ever seen
浮游生物是最可爱的宝宝
我曾经见过

02:06.103 --> 02:08.551
and I'm gonna prove it to him.
我会向他证明这一点。

02:11.758 --> 02:14.448
Eh, keeps him off the streets.
嗯，让他远离街头。

02:18.103 --> 02:19.586
Time to eat, Moby.
吃饭时间到了，莫比。

02:19.689 --> 02:22.896
Oh, you're gonna love
this new whale baby food.
哦，你一定会喜欢的
这种新的鲸鱼婴儿食品。

02:23.000 --> 02:25.172
It's called Baleen Baby...
它的名字叫“巴林宝贝”

02:25.275 --> 02:26.379
baby.
婴儿。

02:27.310 --> 02:29.482
Open up!
打开！

02:30.034 --> 02:30.965
No!
不！

02:31.068 --> 02:32.379
Come on, Moby.
来吧，莫比。

02:32.482 --> 02:36.413
Here comes the submarine
into the lagoon!
潜艇来了
进入泻湖！

02:40.068 --> 02:41.413
No!
不！

02:46.344 --> 02:48.793
Mmm!
嗯！

02:55.724 --> 02:56.862
Da-Da!
哒哒！

02:56.965 --> 02:59.137
I want my Baleen Baby...
我想要我的巴林宝宝...

02:59.241 --> 03:01.482
...baby!
...婴儿！

03:02.103 --> 03:04.793
He called me Da-Da!
他叫我达达！

03:04.896 --> 03:07.034
<i>Your kids will call you Da-Da</i>
<i>你的孩子会叫你Da-Da</i>

03:07.137 --> 03:08.482
<i>as they go ga-ga</i>
<i>他们嘎嘎嘎嘎</i>

03:08.586 --> 03:11.827
<i>for the delicious taste
of Baleen Baby...</i>
<i>为了美味
巴林宝贝...</i>

03:11.931 --> 03:12.655
<i>baby!</i>
<i>宝贝！</i>

03:13.103 --> 03:16.137
And now it's time
to announce the winner...
现在是时候了
宣布获胜者...

03:17.551 --> 03:21.448
...of Baleen Baby food's
cutest baby contest!
...Baleen 婴儿食品
最可爱宝宝大赛！

03:23.517 --> 03:25.689
Baby Plankton!
浮游生物宝宝！

03:26.137 --> 03:28.068
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

03:28.965 --> 03:31.241
Yay! Plankton, look!
耶！浮游生物，看！

03:31.344 --> 03:33.103
SpongeBob was right!
海绵宝宝是对的！

03:33.551 --> 03:36.241
I don't have time
for malarkey now, Karen.
我没有时间
现在就胡言乱语吧，凯伦。

03:36.344 --> 03:38.551
I just ran out of robot oil.
我的机器人油刚刚用完。

03:43.413 --> 03:45.241
<i>Look for Baby Plankton's
picture</i>
<i>寻找浮游生物宝宝
图片</i>

03:45.344 --> 03:48.827
on every jar
of Baleen Baby baby food.
在每个罐子上
Baleen Baby 婴儿食品。

03:49.448 --> 03:50.551
<i>Baby!</i>
<i>宝贝！</i>

03:50.655 --> 03:53.310
Oh, he's gonna love that.
哦，他会喜欢的。

04:02.103 --> 04:04.137
There he is. It's him!
他就在那里。是他！

04:04.241 --> 04:05.448
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

04:05.551 --> 04:07.000
Oh, man!
哦，伙计！

04:08.000 --> 04:10.758
Oh, pardon me.
哦，请原谅我。

04:10.862 --> 04:12.310
After you.
您先请。

04:12.689 --> 04:16.275
Hm. People usually step on me
when I'm shopping.
嗯。人们经常踩我
当我购物时。

04:16.379 --> 04:17.413
Strange.
奇怪的。

04:24.137 --> 04:25.931
Ah, robot oil.
啊，机器人油。

04:28.551 --> 04:29.931
Time to get climbing.
是时候去爬山了。

04:30.034 --> 04:31.103
Oh. Oh, no.
哦。哦，不。

04:31.206 --> 04:32.758
Let me get that for you.
让我帮你拿一下。

04:33.896 --> 04:35.620
Um, thanks?
嗯，谢谢？

04:35.724 --> 04:37.344
Anytime, cutie.
任何时候，小可爱。

04:42.034 --> 04:44.103
I am not a cutie!
我不是小可爱！

04:48.310 --> 04:49.482
Okay, what do I owe you?
好吧，我欠你什么？

04:49.586 --> 04:52.310
It's on the house, sir!
先生，就在房子里！

04:52.413 --> 04:54.068
On account of you being so...
正因为你如此...

04:54.172 --> 04:56.103
...famous!
...著名的！

04:56.965 --> 05:01.551
It's pronounced "infamous,"
but okay...
发音是“臭名昭著”
但好吧...

05:02.586 --> 05:04.965
Have a nice day!
祝你今天过得愉快！

05:10.793 --> 05:12.586
I seen that butt on the TV!
我在电视上看到过那个屁股！

05:13.068 --> 05:16.241
<i>I want my Baleen Baby...</i>
<i>我想要我的 Baleen 宝贝...</i>

05:16.344 --> 05:17.206
<i>baby!</i>
<i>宝贝！</i>

05:17.310 --> 05:18.724
What was that?
那是什么？

05:18.827 --> 05:20.896
Blimping butt cracks!
屁股裂开了！

05:22.862 --> 05:25.551
<i>Buy some Baleen Baby!</i>
<i>买一些鲸鱼宝宝！</i>

05:32.068 --> 05:33.172
Huh?
啊？

05:33.275 --> 05:36.517
Karen!
凯伦！

05:39.931 --> 05:42.655
How dare you give out
my baby mugshots
你怎么敢给出
我的宝贝照片

05:42.758 --> 05:44.137
without my permission!
未经我允许！

05:44.241 --> 05:46.689
As much as I'd like to, Sheldon,
只要我愿意，谢尔顿，

05:46.793 --> 05:49.103
I can't take credit
for this one.
我不能相信
对于这个。

05:50.310 --> 05:52.172
I did it!
我做到了！

05:52.275 --> 05:53.724
Now aren't you happier knowing
现在你知道了不是更高兴吗

05:53.827 --> 05:56.724
that you're still
the cutest baby in town?
你还在
镇上最可爱的宝宝？

05:56.827 --> 05:58.000
No!
不！

05:58.103 --> 06:01.034
I want to strike fear
in the hearts of everyone,
我想要打击恐惧
在每个人的心中，

06:01.137 --> 06:03.689
not make old ladies
pinch my cheek.
不让老太太
捏我的脸颊。

06:03.793 --> 06:05.413
Look at these pinch marks.
看看这些捏痕。

06:07.068 --> 06:10.724
That looks painful.
Sorry about that, Plankton.
看起来很痛苦。
抱歉，浮游生物。

06:11.241 --> 06:14.689
Sorry is for suckers,
SpongeBoob.
对不起是给傻瓜的，
海绵宝宝。

06:14.793 --> 06:17.517
You got me
into this baby picture mess
你得到了我
进入这张混乱的婴儿照片

06:17.620 --> 06:19.931
and you're gonna help me
clean it up!
你会帮助我的
把它清理干净！

06:22.482 --> 06:24.034
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

06:27.241 --> 06:28.413
<i>Here's the plan.</i>
<i>这是计划。</i>

06:28.517 --> 06:31.482
<i>We cover up
all my baby pictures.</i>
<i>我们掩盖
我所有的婴儿照片。</i>

06:36.241 --> 06:37.482
Got it!
知道了！

06:37.586 --> 06:38.896
<i>But first,</i>
<i>但首先，</i>

06:39.000 --> 06:40.655
<i>we chop down the billboards.</i>
<i>我们砍掉广告牌。</i>

06:40.758 --> 06:42.551
Whoa!
哇！

06:43.172 --> 06:46.206
<i>Then, we paint over
the bus ads.</i>
<i>然后，我们画一遍
公交车广告。</i>

06:52.379 --> 06:53.448
Fire!
火！

06:53.551 --> 06:55.689
Whoa!
哇！

07:04.655 --> 07:06.172
I'm okay!
我没事！

07:08.724 --> 07:09.965
<i>And finally,</i>
<i>最后，</i>

07:10.068 --> 07:11.724
<i>we buy up the entire supply</i>
<i>我们买下了全部供应</i>

07:11.827 --> 07:14.137
<i>of Baleen Baby food...</i>
<i>Baleen 婴儿食品...</i>

07:15.517 --> 07:17.310
<i>...and bury it in the desert!</i>
<i>...并将其埋在沙漠中！</i>

07:17.827 --> 07:20.034
- Phew.
- Oh, boy.
- 唷。
- 哦，男孩。

07:20.586 --> 07:21.827
We did it!
我们做到了！

07:21.931 --> 07:25.586
Nobody will ever see
my naked baby photos again.
没有人会看到
又是我的裸体婴儿照片。

07:27.758 --> 07:30.344
Wh-wh-what the heck was that?
什、什、那到底是什么？

07:30.448 --> 07:32.620
S-s-sea coyotes?
S-S-海土狼？

07:39.137 --> 07:42.103
Aw, it's just a bunch
of whale babies.
噢，这只是一堆
鲸鱼宝宝。

07:42.206 --> 07:43.655
They're adorable.
他们很可爱。

07:43.758 --> 07:46.172
Why are they staring at me
like that?
他们为什么盯着我
就这样？

07:47.862 --> 07:49.689
They probably smell
the baby food.
他们可能闻到
婴儿食品。

07:49.793 --> 07:52.034
What do baby whales eat anyway?
小鲸鱼吃什么？

07:52.137 --> 07:53.068
Who cares?
谁在乎？

07:53.172 --> 07:55.620
Toss 'em a jar
and make 'em go away.
扔给他们一个罐子
并让他们走开。

07:57.000 --> 07:59.482
Break it up, babies.
Break it up.
分手吧，宝贝们。
打破它。

08:02.137 --> 08:05.482
"Baleen Baby food
is made of 100%..."
“巴林婴儿食品
是由 100% 制成的……”

08:06.517 --> 08:07.586
"Gulp"?
“咕噜”？

08:07.689 --> 08:09.172
What the heck is "gulp"?
“吞”到底是什么？

08:10.068 --> 08:11.344
"100%...
“100%...
“100%...
“100%...

08:11.448 --> 08:13.551
p-p-p-plankton"?
浮游生物”？

08:15.724 --> 08:18.758
Baleen Baby is plankton!
鲸须宝宝是浮游生物！

08:24.689 --> 08:25.620
Run!
跑步！

08:37.000 --> 08:38.310
Ooh!
哦！

08:49.482 --> 08:52.103
Where are they all coming from?
他们都是从哪里来的？

08:52.206 --> 08:53.137
I don't know.
我不知道。

08:53.241 --> 08:55.482
But I really dig
their whale song.
但我真的很挖
他们的鲸鱼之歌。

08:55.586 --> 08:56.758
Don't listen, SpongeBob!
别听，海绵宝宝！

08:58.379 --> 09:00.827
Some say
the song of a baby whale
有人说
小鲸鱼的歌声

09:00.931 --> 09:02.517
is so hypnotic...
太催眠了...

09:04.862 --> 09:07.413
...it can turn you
into a voracious,
...它可以让你转变
变成贪婪的、

09:07.517 --> 09:08.965
plankton-eating...
吃浮游生物的...

09:11.206 --> 09:12.517
whale!
鲸！

09:19.275 --> 09:21.310
I want my mama!
我想要我的妈妈！

09:36.379 --> 09:37.724
Sweet Neptune!
甜蜜的海王星！

09:59.448 --> 10:01.379
Ew, chum!
呃，伙计！

10:01.482 --> 10:03.172
I must have lost a bet.
我一定是打赌输了。

10:04.724 --> 10:06.413
Help!
帮助！

10:12.275 --> 10:13.517
That's a relief.
这真是一种解脱。

10:13.620 --> 10:15.206
I thought you guys
were gonna eat--
我以为你们
我们要吃——

10:16.793 --> 10:17.965
Yuck!
哎呀！

10:18.068 --> 10:20.172
Ew!
呃！

10:23.206 --> 10:26.413
All right, babies,
leave Plankton alone now.
好吧，宝贝们，
现在别管浮游生物了。

10:32.896 --> 10:36.482
Look what they did
to my antennas, Mommy.
看看他们做了什么
到我的天线，妈妈。

10:38.965 --> 10:42.103
- Whoa!
- I'd know that hiney anywhere.
- 哇！
- 我在任何地方都会认识那个海尼。

10:42.206 --> 10:45.448
Those are Baby Plankton's
famous buns.
这些是浮游生物宝宝的
有名的包子。

10:46.344 --> 10:48.896
I'll kick your buns, you weirdo!
我会踢你的面包，你这个怪人！

10:49.000 --> 10:52.379
I'm just here to give you
the Baleen Baby contest check
我只是来给你
Baleen Baby 竞赛支票

10:52.482 --> 10:55.000
for one jillion dollars...
为了一十亿美元...

10:55.103 --> 10:55.862
baby!
婴儿！

10:55.965 --> 10:57.689
Well...
出色地...

10:57.793 --> 11:00.275
that's a baby food
of a different flavor.
那是婴儿食品
的不同风味。

11:00.379 --> 11:01.517
I accept!
我接受！

11:05.827 --> 11:07.793
Huh? What's that?
啊？那是什么？

11:07.896 --> 11:10.379
Baby Plankton tastes like chum?
浮游生物宝宝尝起来像密友吗？

11:11.068 --> 11:14.034
Ew. That's not gonna be good
for business.
呃。那不会有什么好事
为了生意。

11:15.586 --> 11:17.793
Okay, change of plans!
好吧，计划改变！

11:17.896 --> 11:19.620
We're done
with Dr. Cyclops here,
我们完成了
和独眼巨人博士在这里，

11:19.724 --> 11:24.000
so let's go with the second
best baby photo we have.
那么我们来看看第二个
我们有最好的婴儿照片。

11:27.758 --> 11:28.793
What the...
什么...

11:28.896 --> 11:29.931
Krabs?
螃蟹？

11:32.517 --> 11:33.862
Oh yeah. I forgot.
哦，是的。我忘了。

11:33.965 --> 11:36.586
I sent in Mr. Krabs'
baby photo, too.
我派了蟹老板的
婴儿照片也可以。

11:39.482 --> 11:42.000
Actually, that's adorable.
事实上，这很可爱。

11:43.586 --> 11:45.379
My pinchable cheeks!
我那可捏的脸颊！

我那可捏的脸颊！